# Files excluded from the rsconnect / Posit Connect bundle.
# rsconnect reads a .rscignore PER DIRECTORY and matches entries EXACTLY
# against the names in that directory (no wildcards, no paths). This file
# covers the app root; appData/.rscignore covers the test fixtures there.
